{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51563","headline":"咏石砚 · 李琪","name":"咏石砚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远来柯岭外，近到玉堂间。\n乍琢文犹涩，新磨墨尚悭。\n不能濡大笔，何要别秋山。\n（《文房四谱》三《砚谱》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李琪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}